        4,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://discoverdouglassville.com/douglassville-pennsylvania-local-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Gabriel’s Episcopal Church, founded in 1720, is the oldest church in Berks County and sits in Amity Gardens.",
